<title>USA: Trans World Airlines Jan load factor rises.</title>
<headline>Trans World Airlines Jan load factor rises.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trans World Airlines Inc said said Thursday its load factor was 62.1 percent in January, up from 58.9 percent a year ago.</p>
<p>Revenue passenger miles for the month were 1.9 million, up from 1.8 million a year ago, while available seat miles were 3.0 million, the same as a year ago, the airline said.</p>
<p>TWA shares were unchanged at 6 Thursday.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
